    "body": "This PR fixes a bug in the fee amount calculation in `clnrest` and `corelightningrest` lightning backends. Previously, the fee was calculated as `-int(...) - int(...)` causing negative values. Now it correctly calculates `int(amount_sent_msat) - int(amount_msat)`.\nIt also adds regression tests in mocked backends and includes fee assertions in regtest.",
